WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.772 --> 00:00:15.800
"Hi, Miss Shelly called.

2
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:17.101
"What's that?"

3
00:00:17.121 --> 00:00:19.002
"Just my flute."

4
00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:25.486
Nina tucked the instrument into her backpack.

5
00:00:25.506 --> 00:00:29.288
"I didn't know you played flute," Izzie said.

6
00:00:30.024 --> 00:00:31.525
"I can't play it yet."

7
00:00:32.246 --> 00:00:33.046
Nina sighed.

8
00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:36.949
"I've had three lessons, and I still sound terrible."

9
00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:40.811
"Some things take time," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:40.831 --> 00:00:44.914
"Like today's project—baking banana bread."

11
00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:48.156
"Mmm," Izzie said.

12
00:00:48.176 --> 00:00:50.518
"I love banana bread."

13
00:00:51.639 --> 00:00:53.060
Bobby was rubbing his belly.

14
00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:54.881
"I'm so hungry.

15
00:00:55.401 --> 00:00:56.542
When will it be ready?"

16
00:00:56.562 --> 00:00:58.984
"It's going to take a while.

17
00:00:59.808 --> 00:01:02.589
You have to be patient, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

18
00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:08.212
Everyone put on their aprons, and Jason started reading from the board.

19
00:01:08.232 --> 00:01:10.913
"First we butter a loaf pan."

20
00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:13.774
"I'll do it," Izzie said.

21
00:01:16.895 --> 00:01:18.036
Jason kept reading.

22
00:01:18.976 --> 00:01:22.698
"Mix eight tablespoons of butter with one cup of sugar."

23
00:01:23.838 --> 00:01:25.419
Ethan dumped the butter in a bowl.

24
00:01:26.739 --> 00:01:27.880
Nina added the sugar.

25
00:01:29.364 --> 00:01:32.525
"Mix until it's light and fluffy," Jason said.

26
00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.766
Nina started stirring.

27
00:01:35.387 --> 00:01:36.367
Bobby groaned.

28
00:01:36.387 --> 00:01:39.888
"Can't we use an electric mixer?

29
00:01:40.389 --> 00:01:41.569
It's much faster."

30
00:01:42.529 --> 00:01:43.390
Nina shrugged.

31
00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:45.110
"This works fine."

32
00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:48.032
"Next we add two eggs."

33
00:01:50.533 --> 00:01:52.834
Jason cracked each egg, one at a time.

34
00:01:54.294 --> 00:01:56.195
Nina added them to the mixture.

35
00:01:57.575 --> 00:01:58.736
Bobby grabbed a fork.

36
00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:01.025
"I'll mash the bananas!"

37
00:02:04.848 --> 00:02:06.349
Soon the bananas were mashed.

38
00:02:07.009 --> 00:02:10.672
Jason added one tablespoon of milk and one teaspoon of cinnamon.

39
00:02:12.953 --> 00:02:14.174
Ethan got another bowl.

40
00:02:14.194 --> 00:02:19.858
"Now we have to mix two cups of flour and a teaspoon of baking powder."

41
00:02:19.878 --> 00:02:27.764
"Add one teaspoon of baking soda and one teaspoon of salt," Nina said.

42
00:02:28.972 --> 00:02:30.853
"Oops!" Izzie cried.

43
00:02:30.873 --> 00:02:34.674
"We forgot to preheat the oven!"

44
00:02:34.694 --> 00:02:38.855
"Ugh!" Bobby buried his face in his hands.

45
00:02:40.295 --> 00:02:42.616
"It's fine, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

46
00:02:42.636 --> 00:02:44.917
"We have plenty of time today."

47
00:02:46.077 --> 00:02:47.818
Nina patted Bobby on the shoulder.

48
00:02:47.838 --> 00:02:50.018
"You need more patience.

49
00:02:50.979 --> 00:02:55.340
My flute teacher always says that good things come with patience."

50
00:02:57.404 --> 00:02:59.886
Izzie turned on the oven while Jason checked the board.

51
00:02:59.906 --> 00:03:05.532
"Add the banana mixture to the sugar and butter," he said.

52
00:03:07.914 --> 00:03:10.456
Nina added the sugar mixture to the banana mixture.

53
00:03:12.098 --> 00:03:14.279
Bobby began stirring as fast as he could.

54
00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:17.542
"Here come the dry ingredients!"

55
00:03:18.623 --> 00:03:20.405
Ethan dumped them into Bobby's bowl.

56
00:03:21.346 --> 00:03:23.148
Bobby started to stir fast again.

57
00:03:25.028 --> 00:03:27.190
"Slow down, Bobby," Jason said.

58
00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.392
"You only have to mix until the flour disappears."

59
00:03:32.374 --> 00:03:34.835
"Patience!" Izzie sang out.

60
00:03:36.417 --> 00:03:38.318
Bobby sighed and stirred slowly.

61
00:03:40.039 --> 00:03:42.841
When the batter was ready, Izzie poured it into the pan.

62
00:03:44.062 --> 00:03:45.183
Everyone looked at the oven.

63
00:03:45.203 --> 00:03:48.866
"It's almost ready too," Miss Shelly said.

64
00:03:50.007 --> 00:03:51.588
Bobby slumped onto the table.

65
00:03:52.404 --> 00:03:55.926
"The batter has to bake for one hour and ten minutes.

66
00:03:56.606 --> 00:03:58.727
What are we going to do while we wait?"

67
00:04:00.208 --> 00:04:01.589
Ethan smiled at Nina.

68
00:04:01.609 --> 00:04:03.870
"Can you play your flute for us?"

69
00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.831
"Um Nina hesitated.

70
00:04:06.851 --> 00:04:09.612
"Sure," she said finally.

71
00:04:09.632 --> 00:04:13.374
"As long as you don't mind hearing all my mistakes."

72
00:04:13.394 --> 00:04:15.355
"No problem!"

73
00:04:15.775 --> 00:04:16.596
Jason said.

74
00:04:23.128 --> 00:04:25.810
Ding! At last the timer went off.

75
00:04:26.531 --> 00:04:28.112
Bobby leaped up from his seat.

76
00:04:29.293 --> 00:04:31.074
"Now can we eat the banana bread?"

77
00:04:32.035 --> 00:04:34.356
"Not yet, Bobby," Miss Shelly said.

78
00:04:34.376 --> 00:04:37.198
"It has to cool for 15 minutes."

79
00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.001
Bobby let out a deep sigh.

80
00:04:42.242 --> 00:04:44.083
Nina smiled and looked at her flute.

81
00:04:44.103 --> 00:04:48.446
"Bobby is learning about patience," she thought.

82
00:04:48.466 --> 00:04:50.528
"And so am I!"
